  Description: "Resource Bar Pack The Resource Bar Pack is a multipurpose resource designed to simplify the creation of dynamic resource bars for your projects. Whatever you want to create - life bars, mana bars, power indicators or progress indicators - this pack offers you an all-in-one solution. With scripts and customizable elements, you can easily implement both continuous and segmented bar types. Learn more here"
